  "notes": "Cash basis county audit. Governmental lines from Exhibit D (p4, Total Governmental Funds); no business-type funds. Statement 'Miscellaneous' 262,042 categorized as donations/contributions because the Statement of Activities (p2) shows 250,000 of it as capital grants and contributions; kept as one printed line. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet (p3, Total), whose total equals the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund, Road and Inheritance Tax budget schedules (p5-p8); nonmajor funds from Combining Schedule 2 (p9: Special Revenue Funds combined, Shop Building, Hanich Trust), since Schedule 3 has 7 special revenue fund columns (more than 6) and Schedule 4 budget schedules print only totals (not recorded, to avoid double counting). General Fund budget 'Taxes' 1,184,351 kept taxes (unlabeled): the statement's General column pieces (property 1,134,166 + motor vehicle 50,186 = 1,184,352) do not tie exactly. County Surveyor (Public Works) has a budget of 6,600 but no actual printed, so not recorded. Read pages 1-13 of 13."
